{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","炽翼天翔"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","화염의 날개"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放一道火焰，对波及到的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","화염을 시전하여 영향을 받는 적에게 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向释放一道宽度为3格的火焰，对火焰波及到的敌人造成600% + 60% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","한 방향을 선택하여 3칸 너비의 화염을 시전하여 화염의 영향을 받은 적에게 600% + 60% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至610% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 610% + 60% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至620% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 620% + 60% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"e